name: Ceremonial Dagger — destroy-for-mult
author: corpus
description: >-
  When Blind is selected, Ceremonial Dagger destroys the Joker to its right and
  permanently adds double its sell value to Mult. First-shop scaling: place cheap
  fodder (Abstract, Riff-Raff, Egg) to its right and sell them once big enough.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: CeremonialDagger
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: RiffRaff
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 40
  - joker: Egg
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: GiftCard
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
